      "content": "I'd recommend sending a friendly, yet firm, email to the customer, acknowledging their concern and expressing our willingness to work together to resolve the issue. We can offer a prepaid return shipping label, so they can send the vase back to us at no additional cost to them. This approach shows we value their business and are committed to making things right, while also minimizing the risk of a chargeback dispute. By handling the situation in a proactive and customer-centric manner, we can turn a negative experience into a positive one and maintain a high level of customer satisfaction.",
